A modern, fully‑featured e‑commerce frontend built with Next.js, React, Tailwind CSS, and Stripe.

## Tech Stack

- **Framework**: Next.js 14 (React 18)
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS + Headless UI
- **State**: Zustand + React Query
- **Auth**: Auth0
- **Payments**: Stripe Checkout
- **Testing**: Jest + React Testing Library
- **Deployment**: Vercel

## Getting Started

```bash
git clone https://github.com/yourname/my-ecommerce.git
cd my-ecommerce
cp .env.example .env.local
# fill in your env vars
npm install
npm run dev
